From 13a0b6989b992e0e01d457e93b0cacbb8e508212 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DSH <dsh@local>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 14:49:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 03/21] chore(tts): surface the sentence cadence in the
 notification (measurement build)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The remaining pause is either the engine's own inter-utterance silence or a
structural stall, and only the device can tell which. Sentence-level timing is
already recorded in memory; show it where a release APK can read it — the media
notification title — so the next decision (merge sentences into longer
utterances, or move to synthesize-to-file) is made on numbers instead of a
guess.

Temporary: delete with the metrics once measured.
