Subject: [PATCH 16/21] feat(tts): fetch the model list too, and fix the
 MiniMax preset

MiniMax's current model is speech-2.8-hd, not the speech-02-hd the preset
carried, and its voice list is a POST to /v1/get_voice (the GET is a 404) that
answers under system_voice. Both are now described by the preset.

The model picker fills itself the same way the voice list does: a template may
carry a model-list request, and the editor queries it as soon as a key is
present, falling back to the free-text field when the service will not answer.
